usin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TedKaczynskisCousin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TedKaczynskisCousin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TedKaczynskisCousin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TedKaczynskisCousin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TedKaczynskisCousin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TedKaczynskisCousin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TedKaczynskisCousin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TedKaczynskisCousin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TedKaczynskisCousin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T20:44:20Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T20:47:20Z","body":"> * Related to [GDScript `range(0, 1, 0.1)` returns an empty array #58210](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/58210)\n>   and [[Godot 3.5.3] range(16777217, ...) begins at 16777216 #84166](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/84166).\n> \n> Does it work for iteration if you use `for i in range(large_number)` or `for i in large_number` directly?\n\nFor my specific use-case (and I think this applies to most other people as well), this wouldn't work, since I'm not counting up from 0. That would result in 2 billion operations.\nHowever, using this code (which took me a couple of minutes to execute haha):\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tfor n in 2147483650:\n\t\tif n > 2147483646: print(n)\n```\n I was able to get the following output:\n\n<img width=\"162\" height=\"140\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf3a5bfb-dc42-40c1-b378-5811980b3106\" />\n\n\nEDIT:\nTo contrast, using `for n in range(2147483650)` does not work. I get no output.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3161551233/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3161553564","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109373#issuecomment-3161553564","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109373","id":3161553564,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68cXqc","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T20:45:15Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T20:45:15Z","body":"Seems to be wrong type used in the `range` helper method, should be easy to fix.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3161553564/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3161630713","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109373#issuecomment-3161630713","issue